{"synopsis":"Di dunia ini, ada orang-orang yang disebut Awakeners. Mereka memiliki kekuatan fisik dan kemampuan khusus nan luar biasa. Kannagi Minato, yang setiap hari selalu ditindas, tiba-tiba terjebak dalam situasi hidup dan mati. Saat berada di ujung tanduk, dia mendadak bangkit lagi. Ternyata, di dalam dirinya terdapat roh-roh pahlawan pendiri dunia yang dulu pernah menyelamatkan dunia. Sejak itu, hidupnya berubah drastis.\n\nDari penulis terkenal Etou Shunji, pencipta karya hit “Savior of Divine God Draw Out 0.00000001% To Become the Strongest”!","alternative_title":"나만 최강 초월자 입니다","author":"ETOU Shunji","artist":"3rd Ie, Studio No.9, Fuuwai, TSUCHIDA Kenta","chapters":[{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"41ac80cf-2741-4245-892d-0fc905a11585","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"80f8ed9f-f150-4e6b-b474-ac6527386e9d","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"dd3d8e20-f4f0-49bd-9d82-e58c8f0c8834","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2026-07-28"},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"273a1c4e-6966-4413-8842-e5c851be3de6","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2026-07-27"},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"434de1f0-e0a4-47d0-bf71-0759cc0ab396","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2026-07-27"},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"0973432d-3c82-4884-993b-19127d0dbce5","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2026-03-08"},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"b24704c7-162d-438b-b97a-0c6b25575c03","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2026-03-02"},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"a904c6c2-2845-4549-a624-2db474a56b4f","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2026-03-01"},{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"8f5b44d5-c2d3-41ca-934c-50ff3f4f8736","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2026-02-28"},{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"bdad7bcb-3a84-490b-87ee-ea2228b9242a","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2026-02-19"},{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"588fbef8-91d9-42c3-889d-d3dec70a0ab3","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-02-17"},{"number":"72","c